# Code and text files diff as text even when they hold a NUL byte (test input for a header-injection
# check, say). Otherwise git shows "Binary files differ" and the history name check never sees them.
*.ts diff
*.tsx diff
*.mts diff
*.js diff
*.mjs diff
*.cjs diff
*.jsx diff
*.json diff
*.md diff
*.sql diff
*.prisma diff
*.css diff
*.html diff
*.txt diff
*.toml diff
*.yml diff
*.yaml diff
*.sh diff
